{"state": {"subject": "Immediate Enhancement of Security Protocols Required", "body": "Dear Customer Support,\n\nI am writing to urgently request the integration of upgraded security protocols to bolster data protection across our hospital's medical systems. As the healthcare sector is a primary target for cyberattacks, it is crucial that we adopt proactive measures to safeguard sensitive patient information and prevent potential breaches.\n\nPlease implement the following security measures:\n- Multi-factor authentication for all users\n- Regular software updates and patching\n- Encryption of sensitive data\n\nThank you for understanding the importance of strengthening our security measures. Kindly review the proposed enhancements, including multi-factor authentication, routine software updates, data encryption, incident response planning, and security audits. Please provide a timeline for implementation and any additional recommendations. If needed, I am available for a call at <tel_num> to discuss further. Kindly inform us of a suitable time to schedule this call and outline the next steps.\n\nBest regards,\n\n<name>"}, "questions": {"queue": {"type": "choice", "instructions": "Which support queue should handle this ticket?", "criteria": {"Technical Support": "technical problems, bugs, outages, integrations", "Product Support": "help using a product or feature", "Customer Service": "general account or service questions", "IT Support": "internal IT, devices, access, networks", "Billing and Payments": "invoices, charges, refunds, payment methods", "Returns and Exchanges": "returning or exchanging an item", "Service Outages and Maintenance": "downtime, outages, scheduled maintenance", "Sales and Pre-Sales": "pricing, quotes, buying", "Human Resources": "employment, payroll, leave, hiring", "General Inquiry": "anything else"}}}, "expected": {"queue": "Returns and Exchanges"}, "tags": ["support_tickets", "id:1671", "t3arm:train"], "language": "en"}
